Host: 127.0.0.1:8397
User-Agent: curl/8.7.1
Accept: */*
Authorization: Bearer oracle-mgmt-key-1
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 17


{"enabled":false}

### step 2: GET http://127.0.0.1:8397/v0/management/plugins/example/config (GET plugin config)
